  "description": "All information on this page is specific to the Rune V3 - V3 frames were produced in 2019-2021 and are identifiable by the 31.6mm seat post. If you are seeking information for Rune V3.2 frames released in March 2022, and identifiable by the 30.9mm seat post. Please click here.\nSince the initial release, the Rune has been one of the cornerstones of the Banshee lineup. Interested in epic big mountain adventures and progressing to the park? The 160mm travel Rune has you covered. The Rune is all about inspiring confidence and brewing up fun!\nEvolving alongside the KS2 Link suspension design. The Rune V3.2 benefits from the forged shock cage’s load isolation, and significantly refined stiffness profile… And space for a full size water bottle inside the frame when you want to take on some epic rides.\nHighly refined, the Rune V3.2 builds on everything it has always been, Incredibly balanced geometry and optimal weight distribution. The Rune V3.2 wants to get rowdy, guaranteed to put a huge smile on your face as you’re treated to one hell of a good time!",
